{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500890/extras/SteamDecTitle.png?t=1740146752\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive Deliver Destroy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deliver However is a chaotic sandbox, where every delivery is a disaster waiting to happen.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this physics-driven delivery sim with fully destructible environments you transport all kinds of cargo, smash through buildings, send NPCs ragdolling into suspiciously weak walls, and cause absolute mayhem with your cargo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500890/extras/SteamGif1.gif?t=1740146752\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your cargo and extension of your chaotic self, a tool to obliterate all those that stand in its path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500890/extras/SteamGif2.gif?t=1740146752\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or maybe just make your truck fly because why not?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3500890/extras/SteamGif3.gif?t=1740146752\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't think you'll be limited to just suburbs, a good delivery driver, delivers wherever is needed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha